{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve Your Path to Follow Your Destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/extras/cea1caaf8c8b37a789f83425c69e52a7.poster.avif?t=1750606904\" width=750 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/extras/cea1caaf8c8b37a789f83425c69e52a7.webm?t=1750606904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/extras/cea1caaf8c8b37a789f83425c69e52a7.mp4?t=1750606904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reikon: Reawaken is an immersive action-adventure game that puts you in the shoes of a lone warrior. As you delve into this dangerous world of the fictional Far East, you will encounter a multitude of enemies, each with their own unique abilities and strengths. Fight against enemies that occupy these lands to bring peace and find the answers. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sacred Art of Swordsmanship: Honing Your Skills with Deadly Techniques</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game is the art of swordsmanship. As you progress through the game, you will have the opportunity to hone your skills and become a master swordsman. You will learn a variety of different techniques, from quick slashes to powerful strikes, each with its own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But mastering the sword is not just about physical prowess. It also requires a deep understanding of the art of combat and a keen sense of strategy. You need to be one with your sword and have a great sense of outside threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique control scheme that uses mouse swing for sword attacks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tense sword action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Story-driven gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive environments. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2388540?t=1750606904","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2388540?t=1750606904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750606904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750606904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve Your Path to Follow Your Destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/extras/cea1caaf8c8b37a789f83425c69e52a7.poster.avif?t=1750606904\" width=750 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/extras/cea1caaf8c8b37a789f83425c69e52a7.webm?t=1750606904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/extras/cea1caaf8c8b37a789f83425c69e52a7.mp4?t=1750606904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reikon: Reawaken is an immersive action-adventure game that puts you in the shoes of a lone warrior. As you delve into this dangerous world of the fictional Far East, you will encounter a multitude of enemies, each with their own unique abilities and strengths. Fight against enemies that occupy these lands to bring peace and find the answers. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sacred Art of Swordsmanship: Honing Your Skills with Deadly Techniques</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game is the art of swordsmanship. As you progress through the game, you will have the opportunity to hone your skills and become a master swordsman. You will learn a variety of different techniques, from quick slashes to powerful strikes, each with its own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But mastering the sword is not just about physical prowess. It also requires a deep understanding of the art of combat and a keen sense of strategy. You need to be one with your sword and have a great sense of outside threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique control scheme that uses mouse swing for sword attacks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tense sword action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Story-driven gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive environments. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Exol"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388540/header.jpg?t=1750606904","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2388540/713667/b1986752e996c3bbd5412415438af8132d0d180b/1750914116/dash_av1.mpd?t=1718306916","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2388540/713667/b1986752e996c3bbd5412415438af8132d0d180b/1750914116/dash_h2